visor (phase: late)","Step 11 — Stage 20 Final Review","Step 12 — Stage 21 Deliver","Step 13 — Present deliverables to user"],"name_hint":"viral · launch","description_zh":"统筹原文21智能体产品发布流程，生成X讨论串、LinkedIn帖及ProductHunt文案，对开场、赠品和正文做管理评审及Mom-Test，可恢复执行；以传播为目标，不保证实际爆红。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["viral-launch-pipeline","What it produces","Installation","In Claude Code:","Usage","Start a launch","Resume a launch","Architecture","The 21 stages","Why this works","Requirements","Tips for great launches","Output structure","License","Credit"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitignore","LICENSE","README.md","docs/submission-templates.md","skills/viral-launch/SKILL.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/01_brand_brief.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/02_keywords.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/03_youtube_research.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/04_twitter_research.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/05_reddit_research.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/06_industry_research.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/07_research_compiler.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/08_hook_writer.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/09_hook_manager.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/10_giveaway_writer.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/11_giveaway_manager.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/12_body_writer.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/13_weapons_specialist.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/14_controversy_specialist.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/15_technical_specialist.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/16_flow_specialist.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/17_body_manager.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/18_mom_test.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/19_call_supervisor.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/20_final_review.md","skills/viral-launch/prompts/21_deliver.md","skills/viral-launch/references/artifact-schema.md","skills/viral-launch/references/channel-specs.md","skills/viral-launch/references/hook-three-quest